WEBVTT

01:26.680 --> 01:29.710
[Glory]

01:30.610 --> 01:32.950
[Episode 5]

01:34.120 --> 01:34.759
Let's go.

01:35.039 --> 01:36.070
Since he's gone to Chongxi Hall,

01:36.070 --> 01:37.000
we should leave.

01:37.350 --> 01:38.759
Let's go.

01:44.870 --> 01:46.200
So it's that Yan family.

01:46.840 --> 01:47.840
Which Yan family?

01:47.920 --> 01:49.590
The Yan family was also

01:49.590 --> 01:51.039
a prestigious clan in Linji.

01:51.039 --> 01:52.200
But for some reason,

01:52.509 --> 01:53.479
they suddenly moved

01:53.479 --> 01:55.070
to Shuzhong over a decade ago.

01:55.070 --> 01:55.759
I didn't expect

01:55.759 --> 01:57.479
they would send someone here too.

01:57.479 --> 01:58.590
This is terrible.

01:59.229 --> 02:00.510
The Rong and Yan families

02:00.510 --> 02:02.400
have been intermarrying for centuries.

02:02.400 --> 02:04.790
This one is a formidable rival.

02:32.240 --> 02:33.079
It seems you can't avoid

02:33.079 --> 02:34.740
this kind of person anywhere.

02:35.130 --> 02:36.460
What bad luck.

02:44.610 --> 02:45.410
What's wrong?

02:45.540 --> 02:48.150
Even with the cover of medicinal
and sandalwood incense,

02:48.150 --> 02:50.079
that scent of blood still lingers.

02:51.120 --> 02:53.000
I caught a hint of it during our earlier

02:53.000 --> 02:54.060
encounter as well.

03:03.360 --> 03:05.680
After all the effort
you went through to find it,

03:05.680 --> 03:06.810
you just smashed it?

03:07.120 --> 03:08.120
You really could let it go?

03:08.120 --> 03:09.380
I wanted to please her,

03:09.630 --> 03:11.190
but she cares about
that useless person instead.

03:11.190 --> 03:12.310
Afraid I might hurt him,

03:12.310 --> 03:14.590
she even had someone else
fight in his place.

03:14.590 --> 03:16.630
Not only did it break
the Rong family's rules,

03:16.630 --> 03:18.290
but it was also an insult to me!

03:20.630 --> 03:22.800
No matter how passionately
you bare your heart,

03:22.800 --> 03:23.400
she will still

03:23.400 --> 03:24.800
protect her dear cousin.

03:25.000 --> 03:26.329
What can you do about it?

03:26.800 --> 03:27.800
If you care about the Rong family's

03:27.800 --> 03:28.910
tea plantations in the south

03:28.910 --> 03:30.470
and their maritime tea routes,

03:30.470 --> 03:32.530
you might have to swallow your pride.

03:33.430 --> 03:35.520
No matter who she cares for in her heart,

03:35.520 --> 03:37.250
just focus on winning her over.

03:37.630 --> 03:39.310
If you truly love Miss Rong,

03:40.120 --> 03:41.750
then use patience and persistence,

03:41.750 --> 03:43.550
and you'll surely win her heart.

03:47.630 --> 03:48.800
So you're envious of

03:48.800 --> 03:50.120
Mingzhou's deep-water harbor

03:50.120 --> 03:52.579
and the endless wealth
from maritime trade.

03:52.680 --> 03:54.680
No wonder the He family
is willing to set aside grudges

03:54.680 --> 03:56.240
and desperately wants their bloodline

03:56.240 --> 03:57.560
to merge with the Rongs.

03:57.560 --> 03:59.750
You really are up to no good—

04:00.010 --> 04:01.630
repeatedly provoking me to take action

04:01.630 --> 04:03.230
so you can reap the benefits.

04:04.310 --> 04:05.510
You covet his cousin,

04:05.710 --> 04:07.640
while I want the Rong Family's tea.

04:08.120 --> 04:10.050
There's no difference between us.

04:10.470 --> 04:11.400
Compared to that pretentious

04:11.400 --> 04:13.400
Yan Bailou from the east courtyard,

04:13.590 --> 04:15.430
I'd rather deal with you.

04:16.000 --> 04:18.430
At least your wickedness
is straightforward.

04:18.430 --> 04:19.630
We need to think about

04:19.930 --> 04:21.240
how to deal with

04:21.269 --> 04:22.590
that hindrance.

04:57.800 --> 04:58.510
Spies.

04:59.250 --> 05:00.850
Miss Rong, lower your voice.

05:01.310 --> 05:02.970
Be careful of eavesdroppers.

05:03.800 --> 05:05.040
Forgive me, Miss Rong.

05:05.040 --> 05:06.440
I have confidential matters to report.

05:06.440 --> 05:08.170
Please allow me to come closer.

05:45.640 --> 05:47.500
Please consider this carefully.

05:48.040 --> 05:48.870
Mr. Wen's tea

05:48.870 --> 05:49.930
was tampered with,

05:50.200 --> 05:51.240
He Xingming bribed others

05:51.240 --> 05:52.610
for assistance in advance,

05:52.610 --> 05:54.270
and they even knew the Rong family's

05:54.270 --> 05:55.470
examination topics.

05:56.390 --> 05:57.390
Someone must have

05:57.720 --> 05:59.780
leaked the martial contest details.

06:02.950 --> 06:05.220
[Xinfang Pavilion]

06:10.630 --> 06:12.390
All you do is gamble and drink.

06:13.000 --> 06:14.630
I was only gone for a short while,

06:14.630 --> 06:16.120
and you couldn't even
guard the room properly!

06:16.120 --> 06:18.120
What's the point of keeping you all?

06:18.590 --> 06:20.750
You, come here. Perfect timing.

06:21.360 --> 06:22.940
I've lost several gold ingots,

06:22.940 --> 06:24.720
worth about 1,000 taels of silver.

06:24.720 --> 06:25.600
Those gold

06:25.620 --> 06:27.180
and heavy lumps

06:27.430 --> 06:29.440
would make a sound
if dropped on the floor!

06:29.440 --> 06:31.430
Yet they've vanished from this room.

06:31.430 --> 06:33.680
Those who know think I'm a guest here;

06:33.700 --> 06:34.630
those who don't

06:34.680 --> 06:36.310
would think I've
fallen into a den of thieves!

06:36.310 --> 06:37.270
That's right.

06:37.270 --> 06:38.480
Whoever took them, speak up now.

06:38.480 --> 06:39.010
Speak up.

06:39.400 --> 06:40.730
How do you explain this?

06:43.120 --> 06:44.650
Mr. Yang, please calm down.

06:44.830 --> 06:46.690
Since the items were lost
within the Rong Mansion,

06:46.690 --> 06:48.420
it's our duty to help find them.

06:48.880 --> 06:50.200
I'll give orders immediately

06:50.200 --> 06:52.070
to search Xinfang Pavilion thoroughly.

06:52.070 --> 06:53.470
Searching isn't enough.

06:53.630 --> 06:55.680
The servants must be questioned too.

06:55.680 --> 06:56.310
Of course.

06:56.740 --> 06:59.070
We'll certainly give you an explanation.

06:59.870 --> 07:00.530
Go quickly.

07:00.710 --> 07:01.440
Yes.

07:03.350 --> 07:05.480
Once that thieving servant is caught,

07:05.750 --> 07:08.120
I'll tear his arms off.

07:17.870 --> 07:19.120
I want to see what's happening

07:19.120 --> 07:19.850
in that room.

07:19.890 --> 07:21.120
Why are you stopping me?

07:21.120 --> 07:22.340
Gold ingots were stolen from his room.

07:22.340 --> 07:23.400
Did you steal them?

07:24.360 --> 07:24.950
No?

07:25.110 --> 07:26.460
Then stay out of this mess.

07:26.460 --> 07:28.480
Get involved will only bring trouble.

07:28.480 --> 07:29.240
What you're saying

07:29.240 --> 07:30.500
is quite interesting.

07:31.270 --> 07:33.000
What's that in your hand?

07:35.010 --> 07:35.990
First comes the martial contest,

07:35.990 --> 07:38.070
then there will surely be a literary test.

07:38.070 --> 07:39.390
How are your studies, Young Master?

07:39.390 --> 07:40.590
Can you pass the test?

07:43.070 --> 07:45.670
These are the questions
my cousin leaked to me?

07:47.070 --> 07:49.159
The Rong family's questions seem simple,

07:49.159 --> 07:50.720
but they carry deeper meaning.

07:50.720 --> 07:52.310
Since ancient times, one's character
is revealed by how they handle wine.

07:52.310 --> 07:53.000
Those who misbehave when drunk

07:53.000 --> 07:54.560
will be the first to be expelled.

07:54.560 --> 07:55.920
On the martial arts arena,

07:55.920 --> 07:56.870
they'll naturally test...

07:56.870 --> 07:57.390
Naturally,

07:57.390 --> 07:59.800
they'll test whose
martial skills are superior.

07:59.800 --> 08:00.480
That Mr. Bai who lay on the ground

08:00.480 --> 08:01.680
playing dead during the martial contest

08:01.680 --> 08:03.880
still passed successfully, didn't he?

08:04.120 --> 08:05.040
Well...

08:05.270 --> 08:06.770
Those who train diligently

08:06.770 --> 08:08.230
and show courage can pass.

08:08.720 --> 08:09.560
Those who are shrewd

08:09.560 --> 08:11.360
or favored by luck can also pass.

08:11.530 --> 08:14.220
Clearly, the Rong family has no fixed
rules for choosing a son-in-law.

08:14.220 --> 08:16.120
However, the Rong family
possesses vast wealth,

08:16.120 --> 08:18.130
and Lady Shanbao bears
tremendous responsibility.

08:18.130 --> 08:20.530
She still needs to choose
a worthy partner—

08:20.670 --> 08:21.310
someone

08:21.340 --> 08:23.200
who can win everyone's approval.

08:24.240 --> 08:25.880
The Rong family is in business.

08:25.880 --> 08:28.160
Poetry and essays
are just icing on the cake.

08:28.160 --> 08:29.960
Are you decent at calculations?

08:31.020 --> 08:33.710
The Rong family's horses
and ships are loaded with tea.

08:33.710 --> 08:35.840
How much do you know about tea affairs?

08:37.080 --> 08:38.909
Well, um...

08:39.390 --> 08:39.909
I...

08:42.510 --> 08:44.830
Better late than never, I suppose.

08:45.680 --> 08:46.890
What about that Yang Dingchen outside?

08:46.890 --> 08:47.990
Are you really not going to deal with him?

08:47.990 --> 08:49.120
Tonight I'll have extra candles

08:49.120 --> 08:50.120
sent to your room.

08:50.380 --> 08:52.040
You should focus on studying.

08:53.510 --> 08:55.110
Stop worrying about others.

10:18.480 --> 10:19.140
Steward Lu!

10:19.270 --> 10:20.630
Something terrible has happened!

10:20.630 --> 10:21.480
There's a poisonous snake

10:21.480 --> 10:22.480
in Mr. Wen's room!

10:22.510 --> 10:23.170
Steward Lu!

10:35.220 --> 10:35.750
Get him!

10:35.750 --> 10:36.390
Get him!

10:36.390 --> 10:37.360
Quick, bring the lantern over here!

10:37.360 --> 10:37.870
Who...

10:38.360 --> 10:39.420
Who are you people?

10:40.600 --> 10:41.480
Don't waste words with him.

10:41.480 --> 10:42.890
Let's go to the hall to talk.

10:42.890 --> 10:43.420
Let's go.

10:53.300 --> 10:53.780
Wanwan.

10:57.790 --> 10:58.450
Beautiful.

10:59.430 --> 11:00.750
Mrs. Yan, look.

11:00.790 --> 11:02.000
Sister made this for me.

11:02.000 --> 11:02.720
Isn't it pretty?

11:02.720 --> 11:03.670
Yes.

11:03.810 --> 11:05.700
It looks lovely on you, My Lady.

11:13.090 --> 11:13.890
Lady Shanbao,

11:14.030 --> 11:15.360
at Xinfang Pavilion...

11:19.280 --> 11:20.540
Wanwan's flower crown

11:20.550 --> 11:22.160
needs a few more pink camellias.

11:22.160 --> 11:24.360
I'll go pick some from the garden for you.

11:24.360 --> 11:25.560
Be good and wait here.

11:26.200 --> 11:27.200
Hurry back then.

11:27.200 --> 11:28.150
I'll be waiting.

11:37.920 --> 11:39.700
There are many visitors
in the house lately.

11:39.700 --> 11:42.760
Don't take Wanwan wandering around
unless necessary.

11:46.310 --> 11:47.040
Yes.

11:52.830 --> 11:53.790
Mrs. Yan.

11:57.670 --> 11:58.430
Mrs. Yan,

11:58.700 --> 12:00.270
I want this yellow one.

12:00.910 --> 12:01.440
Alright.

12:07.190 --> 12:08.850
I heard shouting outside at night,

12:08.850 --> 12:09.910
saying that there was

12:09.910 --> 12:10.900
a poisonous snake in Mr. Wen's room.

12:10.900 --> 12:12.090
I hurried to check,

12:12.830 --> 12:14.690
but someone ambushed me halfway.

12:15.120 --> 12:16.320
I'm just as confused.

12:16.480 --> 12:17.120
I don't know which

12:17.120 --> 12:18.510
house rule I've violated

12:18.510 --> 12:20.310
to be seized without any reason.

12:24.550 --> 12:25.960
What happened tonight

12:26.870 --> 12:29.270
is witnessed by
all the young masters here.

12:30.150 --> 12:31.440
How dare you

12:31.440 --> 12:32.300
tell such lies?

12:32.790 --> 12:33.590
That's right.

12:33.810 --> 12:35.210
There was indeed a snake,

12:35.650 --> 12:36.410
but it was in

12:36.590 --> 12:37.670
Mr. Yang's room.

12:39.480 --> 12:40.140
Someone did

12:40.440 --> 12:41.910
plant a snake in Mr. Yang's room.

12:41.910 --> 12:42.840
Everyone saw it.

12:43.670 --> 12:44.330
This is bad.

12:45.510 --> 12:46.320
Steward Cheng,

12:46.320 --> 12:47.350
I led people to search

12:47.350 --> 12:48.810
and found this in his room.

12:51.080 --> 12:52.170
Well, well!

12:52.430 --> 12:52.920
I...

12:54.200 --> 12:55.730
So it was you who stole them,

12:55.750 --> 12:57.210
making the rest of us suspects!

12:57.210 --> 12:59.140
How vicious an inside thief can be!

13:01.110 --> 13:01.560
You...

13:01.590 --> 13:02.830
I see now.

13:03.630 --> 13:05.840
It must have been him
who stole my valuables.

13:05.840 --> 13:07.170
After I made such a fuss this afternoon,

13:07.170 --> 13:09.250
he feared someone would
search and find them,

13:09.250 --> 13:11.710
so he planted
a green bamboo viper in my room.

13:12.120 --> 13:14.240
Fortunately, my servant
was alert at night

13:14.240 --> 13:16.320
and so he failed.

13:18.630 --> 13:20.320
Truly, heaven protects the virtuous!

13:20.320 --> 13:21.720
If Mr. Yang really suffered

13:21.720 --> 13:23.440
from poison because of five gold ingots,

13:23.440 --> 13:24.270
then the Rong family

13:24.270 --> 13:26.400
would be guilty of harboring thieves.

13:28.510 --> 13:30.960
It's pitiful that such a young child

13:31.270 --> 13:33.470
had to take the calamity for his master.

13:33.630 --> 13:34.480
Bear with it.

13:40.270 --> 13:41.500
My little Jifa.

13:45.600 --> 13:46.150
Fusheng,

13:46.750 --> 13:49.000
we have both witnesses
and evidence right here.

13:49.000 --> 13:50.530
Do you have anything to say?

13:51.910 --> 13:52.770
Steward Cheng,

13:53.320 --> 13:55.600
I was well aware that the mansion
was searching for stolen goods.

13:55.600 --> 13:56.670
If I had taken the gold ingots,

13:56.670 --> 13:58.480
I would've buried them
in a secluded place

13:58.480 --> 14:00.360
and retrieved them
after things had calmed down.

14:00.360 --> 14:02.390
Why would I openly hide them in my room?

14:02.390 --> 14:03.080
Moreover,

14:03.120 --> 14:04.840
the entire garden is full of tea trees.

14:04.840 --> 14:06.240
Spring thunder could
startle snakes to slither about.

14:06.240 --> 14:07.720
It's possible they might
have disturbed the guests.

14:07.720 --> 14:08.480
Why insist

14:08.480 --> 14:09.390
that I did it?

14:10.150 --> 14:10.840
Besides,

14:11.360 --> 14:12.320
he could catch the slithering snake,

14:12.320 --> 14:13.150
yet somehow

14:13.270 --> 14:15.440
he let the culprit
who planted the snake escape.

14:15.440 --> 14:16.970
Isn't that rather strange?

14:17.390 --> 14:18.840
With both stolen goods and witnesses,

14:18.840 --> 14:20.670
how dare a mere servant like you argue!

14:20.670 --> 14:21.270
Everyone,

14:21.720 --> 14:23.550
if this happened in my household,

14:23.550 --> 14:24.750
he'd be beaten to death on the spot!

14:24.750 --> 14:25.390
Exactly!

14:25.790 --> 14:27.440
Just stealing the gold would be one thing,

14:27.440 --> 14:29.120
but using snakes
to harm people is unforgivable.

14:29.120 --> 14:30.670
This servant stole from his own household.

14:30.670 --> 14:32.080
He should be flogged 100 times!

14:32.080 --> 14:34.000
According to the law of theft,
he should be sentenced to be hanged!

14:34.000 --> 14:35.360
Mr. He speaks rightly.

14:35.750 --> 14:37.550
Drag him away and beat him to death!

14:37.550 --> 14:39.270
Which of his points is unreasonable

14:39.270 --> 14:39.960
that he must be punished?

14:39.960 --> 14:40.910
Even the County Office

14:40.910 --> 14:42.390
allows the accused to plead their case.

14:42.390 --> 14:42.910
You...

14:43.150 --> 14:45.550
You're more tyrannical
than the county magistrate!

14:45.550 --> 14:46.390
You're actually trying

14:46.390 --> 14:48.150
to take someone's life so casually.

14:48.150 --> 14:49.910
All of you here are educated men.

14:49.910 --> 14:51.170
Did the sages teach you

14:51.440 --> 14:52.550
to be arrogant with your talents

14:52.550 --> 14:54.150
and treat human lives so lightly?

14:54.150 --> 14:55.910
All... all your

14:55.910 --> 14:57.440
learning has gone to waste!

14:57.870 --> 14:58.480
What are you saying?

14:58.480 --> 14:59.510
You're so eager

14:59.510 --> 15:00.630
to defend a thief.

15:00.960 --> 15:01.720
I wonder

15:02.510 --> 15:03.790
are you the one who told him
to plant the snake?

15:03.790 --> 15:04.870
-I...
-Yes, it was him!

15:04.870 --> 15:06.080
Seeing he couldn't measure up to others,

15:06.080 --> 15:07.200
he incited his servant to harm people.

15:07.200 --> 15:08.360
We haven't even started on you yet.

15:08.360 --> 15:09.790
Reckless behavior!
You're in this together!

15:09.790 --> 15:11.440
We should tie you up and charge you both!

15:11.440 --> 15:12.150
That's right! Exactly!

15:12.150 --> 15:12.790
Am I wrong?

15:12.790 --> 15:13.840
Have you forgotten what you just said?

15:13.840 --> 15:14.440
Let go!

15:21.480 --> 15:22.340
Steward Cheng,

15:22.600 --> 15:24.600
I am lowly and insignificant,
not worth mentioning.

15:24.600 --> 15:25.200
But they have

15:25.200 --> 15:26.000
treated Lady Shanbao's cousin

15:26.000 --> 15:26.750
like a thief.

15:27.600 --> 15:28.750
All this talk of thieves' dens,

15:28.750 --> 15:30.120
stealing from one's own household...

15:30.120 --> 15:31.240
Which family are they insulting?

15:31.240 --> 15:32.960
Who exactly are they disrespecting?

15:32.960 --> 15:34.530
Insulting me alone is one thing,

15:34.530 --> 15:35.390
but they've also

15:35.390 --> 15:36.510
insulted my masters as well.

15:36.510 --> 15:38.190
How is this a marriage proposal visit?

15:38.190 --> 15:39.850
It's clearly troublemaking!

15:40.000 --> 15:40.860
Steward Cheng,

15:41.130 --> 15:42.300
things have gotten this far.

15:42.300 --> 15:44.500
Are you just going to stand by and watch?

15:47.630 --> 15:49.230
Gentlemen, mind your words.

15:49.520 --> 15:51.580
If you speak inappropriately again,

15:51.790 --> 15:54.850
don't blame the Rong family
for disrespecting guests.

15:56.510 --> 15:57.150
Nonsense!

15:57.750 --> 15:58.720
Are you trying

15:58.720 --> 15:59.910
to shift the blame?

16:00.320 --> 16:00.960
We're scolding

16:00.960 --> 16:02.150
only you, this servant.

16:02.150 --> 16:04.440
Guards! Take him away immediately!

16:04.910 --> 16:06.440
Tear out his filthy tongue!

16:06.600 --> 16:07.960
Give him 100 lashes before questioning!

16:07.960 --> 16:08.480
Wait.

16:10.670 --> 16:11.200
Mr. Yang,

16:11.840 --> 16:13.600
if not for his sake, then for mine.

16:13.600 --> 16:15.120
This man is from Qilan Garden.

16:15.120 --> 16:16.000
I cannot decide his fate.

16:16.000 --> 16:17.130
This is not allowed.

16:17.960 --> 16:20.200
He used poison to harm others,
which is a heinous crime.

16:20.200 --> 16:21.390
Consider it as doing your lady a favor,

16:21.390 --> 16:22.480
punishing evil.

16:23.600 --> 16:24.870
We'll handle it ourselves

16:24.870 --> 16:26.470
and won't trouble you at all.

16:26.720 --> 16:27.380
But this...

16:31.260 --> 16:32.740
Do it now!

16:33.120 --> 16:33.720
Arrest him!

16:33.720 --> 16:34.410
Let's see who dares!

16:34.410 --> 16:35.360
-Let go!
-Seize him!

16:35.360 --> 16:36.160
Drag him away!

16:36.240 --> 16:37.100
Let's see where you can go!

16:37.100 --> 16:38.270
-Release me!
-Don't try to escape!

16:38.270 --> 16:38.990
You too!

16:39.730 --> 16:40.950
How dare you!

16:41.750 --> 16:42.390
Let go!

16:48.120 --> 16:48.670
Guards!

16:49.890 --> 16:50.550
-Yes.
-Mr. Wen!

16:50.550 --> 16:51.480
If you can't subdue him,

16:51.480 --> 16:52.510
each of you will take

16:52.510 --> 16:53.770
20 lashes in his place.

16:54.220 --> 16:54.690
Let go.

16:54.720 --> 16:55.080
Go!

16:57.630 --> 16:58.240
Mr. Wen!

16:59.240 --> 16:59.870
Let me go!

17:03.270 --> 17:03.960
Mr. Wen!

17:09.410 --> 17:10.069
Stop!

17:11.109 --> 17:12.109
Serves you right!

17:33.730 --> 17:34.930
Lady Shanbao is here.

17:35.750 --> 17:36.810
Won't you stop now?

17:57.590 --> 17:58.990
Lady Shanbao, this is...

17:59.590 --> 18:00.990
Are you all here as guests

18:01.510 --> 18:02.640
or to cause trouble?

18:03.640 --> 18:05.590
Fighting like this, losing all dignity—

18:05.590 --> 18:06.920
where are your manners?

18:14.070 --> 18:14.680
Get up.

18:26.830 --> 18:27.550
Mr. Wen.

19:00.070 --> 19:01.000
Are you alright?

19:01.270 --> 19:01.870
Thank you.

19:03.960 --> 19:05.090
Where's the doctor?

19:05.790 --> 19:06.720
Coming, coming!

19:08.720 --> 19:09.350
Coming.

19:11.270 --> 19:13.160
Shanbao, don't worry about me.

19:13.640 --> 19:14.270
I'm fine.

19:14.550 --> 19:16.350
I just took a few sneaky punches.

19:16.440 --> 19:17.570
Please don't worry.

19:17.590 --> 19:18.240
D-Doctor,

19:18.680 --> 19:19.540
go check on him.

19:20.550 --> 19:22.720
I'm fine. I'm fine, Shanbao.

19:23.240 --> 19:25.110
Young man, where are you hurt?

19:25.310 --> 19:26.040
I'm fine too.

19:27.000 --> 19:28.530
Go get medicine for Mr. Wen.

19:28.920 --> 19:29.480
Go.

19:30.640 --> 19:31.440
Lady Shanbao,

19:32.650 --> 19:34.310
that scoundrel stole my gold,

19:34.400 --> 19:36.510
yet your cousin blatantly shielded him,

19:36.510 --> 19:37.970
stirring public outrage.

19:38.640 --> 19:40.500
I hope you'll handle this fairly,

19:40.590 --> 19:41.430
without bias,

19:41.920 --> 19:43.450
to quiet the public outcry.

19:43.920 --> 19:45.720
We spoke out against injustice.

19:45.920 --> 19:47.240
We tried to reason with him,

19:47.240 --> 19:49.370
but he insisted on helping that thief.

19:49.400 --> 19:50.400
We are outsiders here.

19:50.400 --> 19:51.350
Please make a fair judgment, Lady Shanbao.

19:51.350 --> 19:52.880
I've always trusted those I employ

19:52.880 --> 19:54.680
and not employ those I distrust.

19:55.000 --> 19:56.730
By accusing him of theft today,

19:57.350 --> 19:59.210
you're questioning my judgment,

19:59.310 --> 20:01.160
suggesting I can't tell
loyalty from treachery,

20:01.160 --> 20:02.890
and that I've harbored a thief?

20:04.750 --> 20:06.080
As we live in this world,

20:06.640 --> 20:08.240
our words can cut like an axe.

20:08.790 --> 20:09.960
Speak with malice

20:10.510 --> 20:13.040
and you'll inevitably
face the retribution.

20:17.640 --> 20:18.240
Fusheng,

20:19.680 --> 20:22.750
Public clamor can melt metals;
Slander can destroy one's reputation.

20:22.750 --> 20:24.550
If you can prove your innocence,

20:25.160 --> 20:26.420
then let everyone know

20:27.680 --> 20:30.540
that Lady Shanbao hasn't
trusted the wrong person.

20:36.510 --> 20:37.920
I owe Miss Rong my life,

20:38.510 --> 20:40.310
and I'm willing to repay her kindness
with my life.

20:40.310 --> 20:42.200
My own life and honor are trivial matters,

20:42.200 --> 20:43.070
but I cannot allow Miss Rong

20:43.070 --> 20:44.600
to be wronged because of me.

20:45.000 --> 20:47.400
Since the stolen goods
were found in my room,

20:47.400 --> 20:49.260
I humbly request everyone to come

20:49.350 --> 20:51.010
and take a look inside my room.

20:57.880 --> 20:58.640
Lady Shanbao,

20:58.640 --> 20:59.640
it was me and Jingzhong who

20:59.640 --> 21:01.000
discovered the stolen goods

21:01.000 --> 21:03.800
tied with a red string
hanging under the bed board.

21:04.000 --> 21:04.660
Right here.

21:05.680 --> 21:06.920
W-Why… Why is the cinnabar

21:06.920 --> 21:08.580
scattered all over the floor?

21:25.350 --> 21:27.480
Cinnabar? What cinnabar?

21:28.270 --> 21:30.200
Where did this cinnabar come from?

21:30.240 --> 21:31.510
Please forgive me, My Lady.

21:31.510 --> 21:32.590
At noon he reported that

21:32.590 --> 21:34.440
Mr. Wen wasn't sleeping well at night

21:34.440 --> 21:34.920
and asked for some

21:34.920 --> 21:36.830
cinnabar, coptis, and roasted licorice,

21:36.830 --> 21:38.310
requesting me to make a sachet

21:38.310 --> 21:39.960
to help Mr. Wen calm his mind.

21:40.270 --> 21:41.510
I thought it was too much trouble,

21:41.510 --> 21:43.910
so I told him to put it
in the pillow instead,

21:44.070 --> 21:45.310
then sent him away.

21:49.640 --> 21:51.160
It's my fault for not being careful.

21:51.160 --> 21:53.620
I didn't realize
it had spilled everywhere.

21:55.480 --> 21:56.110
Right!

21:57.110 --> 21:58.240
This is providence.

21:58.590 --> 21:59.830
Someone waited until I left

21:59.830 --> 22:01.310
to plant stolen goods in my room.

22:01.310 --> 22:02.480
We only need to check the shoe soles

22:02.480 --> 22:04.080
to know who the real thief is.

22:04.790 --> 22:06.530
-That makes sense.
-He's right.

22:06.530 --> 22:08.130
One check and it'll be clear.

22:17.440 --> 22:18.370
Don't be afraid.

22:18.640 --> 22:20.840
Those who searched should be innocent.

22:21.030 --> 22:23.240
But those who deliberately framed others

22:23.240 --> 22:24.700
won't escape punishment.

22:31.750 --> 22:32.840
Take off his shoes.

22:44.000 --> 22:44.960
There's cinnabar.

22:44.960 --> 22:46.730
-It's him.
-It was actually him.

22:46.730 --> 22:47.940
Lady Shanbao!

22:48.020 --> 22:48.920
I've been wronged!

22:48.920 --> 22:50.380
I know nothing about this!

22:52.830 --> 22:54.640
So you're the greedy thief

22:55.310 --> 22:56.970
who has been fooling all of us.

22:58.220 --> 22:59.750
I knew someone as shifty-eyed as you

22:59.750 --> 23:00.700
couldn't be trusted.

23:00.700 --> 23:01.920
You stole my belongings

23:01.920 --> 23:03.600
and even dared to frame someone else!

23:03.600 --> 23:04.510
I can't believe there's

23:04.510 --> 23:05.680
such a shameless

23:05.680 --> 23:06.960
and ungrateful thief in this world!

23:06.960 --> 23:08.920
Speak! Why did you frame him?

23:11.070 --> 23:12.670
Is this truly what happened?

23:16.600 --> 23:19.000
I was in charge of
the food in this pavilion,

23:19.070 --> 23:20.580
with a monthly wage of one tael,

23:20.580 --> 23:22.520
plus additional tips
from the noble guests.

23:22.520 --> 23:23.590
But all of it was taken by that

23:23.590 --> 23:24.590
backdoor dealer.

23:24.960 --> 23:26.920
I wish I could tear him to pieces!

23:30.790 --> 23:32.350
It was all a misunderstanding.

23:32.350 --> 23:33.640
My rush to catch the thief

23:33.640 --> 23:35.770
ended up wronging an innocent person.

23:42.030 --> 23:44.230
Wronging a servant or two is no big deal.

23:44.280 --> 23:45.340
However, Mr. Yang,

23:45.400 --> 23:47.640
you shouldn't have believed others' gossip

23:47.640 --> 23:49.850
and falsely accused Lady Shanbao
of poor judgment and harboring thieves.

23:49.850 --> 23:51.310
If this spreads tomorrow,

23:51.550 --> 23:53.070
it will damage
the Rong family's reputation.

23:53.070 --> 23:54.600
If Old Madam Rong finds out,

23:55.000 --> 23:56.000
she wouldn't approve of those

23:56.000 --> 23:56.860
troublemakers

23:57.180 --> 23:58.160
and dishonorable men

23:58.160 --> 24:00.160
becoming her granddaughter's husband.

24:00.160 --> 24:01.490
Should her anger flare,

24:01.640 --> 24:02.720
may I ask, how could

24:03.540 --> 24:04.680
any of you rest easy?

24:05.780 --> 24:07.160
Please calm down, Lady Shanbao.

24:07.160 --> 24:08.960
We were too gullible.

24:09.680 --> 24:10.670
It's just a trivial matter.

24:10.670 --> 24:12.270
We wouldn't dare
disturb Old Madam Rong.

24:12.270 --> 24:13.920
Please forgive our rashness.

24:13.920 --> 24:15.270
We won't disturb you any further.

24:15.270 --> 24:16.670
We'll take our leave now.

24:16.930 --> 24:17.640
Yes.

24:17.680 --> 24:19.010
We'll leave right away.

24:19.830 --> 24:20.510
Be my guest.

24:24.210 --> 24:25.160
Let's go. Let's go.

24:25.160 --> 24:25.790
Hurry up.

24:37.710 --> 24:38.310
What is it?

24:39.230 --> 24:41.290
Mr. Yang, you still have grievances?

24:41.300 --> 24:43.300
It seems the Rong family
hasn't been hospitable enough,

24:43.300 --> 24:45.500
and has mistreated our esteemed guest.

24:45.710 --> 24:47.990
Why don't you come with me
to see my grandmother

24:47.990 --> 24:50.120
and let her be the judge of this matter?

25:01.880 --> 25:03.340
Lady Shanbao, never mind.

25:03.560 --> 25:06.360
I'm simply too kindhearted and gullible,

25:06.540 --> 25:08.670
easily influenced
and manipulated by others.

25:08.670 --> 25:10.150
I've rashly offended you,

25:10.310 --> 25:12.030
and should apologize profusely.

25:12.030 --> 25:13.000
But my poor Jifa

25:13.000 --> 25:14.640
is suffering terribly from snake venom.

25:14.640 --> 25:16.070
I'm extremely worried

25:16.150 --> 25:17.640
and want to hurry back to check on him.

25:17.640 --> 25:20.370
I'll come tomorrow
to properly apologize to you.

25:36.230 --> 25:38.830
Thank you, Lady Shanbao,
for clearing my name.

25:40.000 --> 25:40.590
Mr. Yan,

25:41.200 --> 25:43.330
thank you for speaking up for justice.

25:48.330 --> 25:50.070
You're becoming increasingly useless,

25:50.070 --> 25:52.730
can't even handle
such a small matter properly.

25:52.820 --> 25:54.380
I handled this poorly

25:54.900 --> 25:56.330
which led to such a mess.

25:57.640 --> 25:58.920
I know I've made a serious mistake.

25:58.920 --> 26:00.480
I'll accept whatever
punishment you see fit.

26:00.480 --> 26:02.740
Go find the steward for your punishment.

26:04.130 --> 26:04.690
Yes.

26:05.680 --> 26:06.480
Lady Shanbao,

26:07.300 --> 26:09.000
besides those who planted evidence,

26:09.000 --> 26:10.200
the servants who searched

26:10.200 --> 26:11.200
this room tonight

26:11.540 --> 26:12.550
should also be detained

26:12.550 --> 26:13.640
and interrogated strictly.

26:13.640 --> 26:16.100
Also, those responsible for night patrols—

26:16.200 --> 26:18.000
how exactly was the snake let in?

26:18.030 --> 26:19.960
They should all be questioned too.

26:21.800 --> 26:23.290
Please forgive me, Lady Shanbao!

26:23.290 --> 26:24.730
I'm innocent!

26:25.730 --> 26:26.820
Innocent or not,

26:27.520 --> 26:29.440
we'll find out after interrogation.

26:29.440 --> 26:30.000
Guards!

26:32.670 --> 26:33.480
Move! Get up!

26:33.480 --> 26:34.200
Lady Shanbao, please save us!

26:34.200 --> 26:35.860
We had nothing to do with this!

26:36.080 --> 26:36.520
Go!

26:37.180 --> 26:37.980
Lady Shanbao!

26:47.160 --> 26:48.270
Look at that glare—

26:48.580 --> 26:50.180
as if I were some scheming

26:50.300 --> 26:53.160
consort whispering
poison into the emperor's ear.

26:54.230 --> 26:55.960
You still have the mood to joke?

26:56.270 --> 26:57.730
After all this commotion,

26:58.000 --> 26:59.200
how is your old wound?

27:00.070 --> 27:00.550
I...

27:04.350 --> 27:05.440
Quickly, get Mr. Zhao.

27:05.440 --> 27:05.720
Yes.

27:05.720 --> 27:06.650
No need for that.

27:07.830 --> 27:09.090
I can treat this wound.

27:16.070 --> 27:17.230
I didn't expect Mr. Yan

27:17.230 --> 27:18.830
would know medicine as well.

27:19.400 --> 27:20.910
The mountains are full of herbs.

27:20.910 --> 27:23.440
I've read a few medical books
in my spare time.

27:23.580 --> 27:25.180
I can handle minor ailments.

27:25.260 --> 27:27.500
But your injury is too severe.

27:28.270 --> 27:30.530
You need to rest properly for half a year.

27:30.550 --> 27:31.920
If the wound reopens,

27:32.550 --> 27:34.750
not even Hua Tuo himself could save you.

27:34.910 --> 27:35.570
Well, I just

27:35.790 --> 27:37.800
have a restless nature
and can't stand being idle.

27:37.800 --> 27:40.260
Just give me some
more hemostatic medicine.

27:51.550 --> 27:54.680
External wounds are easy to treat;
internal organs are not.

27:54.680 --> 27:56.080
Your regular medication

27:56.310 --> 27:58.030
needs to add sour jujube seeds

27:58.340 --> 27:59.400
and albizzia bark.

28:00.270 --> 28:01.730
Has my condition changed?

28:01.980 --> 28:04.100
When the five senses are clear,
gold easily transforms.

28:04.100 --> 28:06.590
When the three minds are unsettled,
water hardly dissipates.

28:06.590 --> 28:09.640
Your inner fire is too strong,
and your senses are restless.

28:09.640 --> 28:13.230
You must calm your mind and worry less.

28:16.030 --> 28:17.490
You speak like a Buddhist,

28:17.560 --> 28:19.200
so why do you still come
to propose marriage?

28:19.200 --> 28:20.400
If you truly have no desires,

28:20.400 --> 28:22.130
why would you still want a wife?

28:22.240 --> 28:24.170
When others insult me and bully me,

28:24.310 --> 28:25.970
you still tell me to stay calm.

28:26.550 --> 28:28.280
If a villain were to spit on you,

28:28.640 --> 28:30.170
could you really endure it?

28:30.480 --> 28:32.200
My master said my earthly
ties aren't yet severed,

28:32.200 --> 28:32.960
so I came.

28:33.630 --> 28:35.360
This is called following fate.

28:35.550 --> 28:36.750
When someone spits on my face,

28:36.750 --> 28:38.040
just let it dry by itself.

28:38.040 --> 28:39.130
It saves me effort

28:39.480 --> 28:40.790
and spares others trouble.

28:40.790 --> 28:42.550
This is called accepting one's lot.

28:42.550 --> 28:44.200
Step away from right and wrong conflicts,

28:44.200 --> 28:46.130
and you'll find true peace of mind.

28:46.440 --> 28:47.000
Stop.

28:48.110 --> 28:49.920
You truly are magnanimous.

28:50.220 --> 28:50.950
As for me,

28:51.070 --> 28:52.930
I'm just a narrow-minded mortal.

28:53.340 --> 28:55.800
I tally every slight
and repay every grudge.

28:55.880 --> 28:56.400
You'd better

28:56.400 --> 28:57.530
not waste your words

28:57.820 --> 28:59.080
trying to persuade me.

29:14.080 --> 29:14.990
How is he?

29:17.070 --> 29:17.720
He's fine.

29:22.670 --> 29:24.870
Lady Shanbao, come with me for a moment.

29:26.790 --> 29:27.480
What's up?

29:34.370 --> 29:36.830
If you have insomnia
or palpitations again,

29:37.160 --> 29:39.090
just massage the Baihui acupoint,

29:39.290 --> 29:40.910
the Shuaigu acupoint above the ear tip,

29:40.910 --> 29:41.840
and the temples.

29:42.350 --> 29:45.080
They all help calm the mind
and soothe the spirit.

30:01.680 --> 30:02.370
In the past,

30:03.170 --> 30:03.640
I was only

30:03.640 --> 30:05.440
close to deer in the wilderness.

30:05.530 --> 30:07.430
I'm not used to dealing with people.

30:07.430 --> 30:08.630
I acted impulsively.

30:09.650 --> 30:10.180
However,

30:10.690 --> 30:13.100
peace of mind is essential for good sleep.

30:14.160 --> 30:15.070
These men

30:15.990 --> 30:18.120
have thrown the Rong family into chaos

30:18.310 --> 30:19.840
and it's truly disgusting.

30:20.610 --> 30:23.190
Since ancient times, the problem
has never been scarcity, but inequality.

30:23.190 --> 30:25.720
Your excessive favoritism
toward one person

30:26.140 --> 30:27.140
not only harms him

30:27.940 --> 30:30.000
but also provokes everyone's anger.

30:31.720 --> 30:33.380
You blame me for being biased?

30:35.080 --> 30:35.880
Rong Shanbao,

30:36.920 --> 30:38.180
you are indeed biased.

30:39.600 --> 30:42.160
Childhood sweethearts
may share deep feelings,

30:42.160 --> 30:45.410
but latecomers may not
necessarily have shallow connections.

30:45.410 --> 30:46.670
You should treat me...

30:49.750 --> 30:50.600
and others

30:52.200 --> 30:52.960
more fairly.

31:02.090 --> 31:04.150
Lady Shanbao, Steward Zhang is here.

31:09.200 --> 31:11.040
The person you asked about

31:11.180 --> 31:12.810
was originally a servant in the household

31:12.810 --> 31:14.940
of Luo Zhan, the Governor of Yingtian.

31:15.050 --> 31:16.020
From the age of five,

31:16.020 --> 31:17.610
he accompanied
the eldest grandson of the Luo family,

31:17.610 --> 31:19.240
Luo Chuance, as his study companion.

31:19.240 --> 31:20.890
But the absurdity

31:20.920 --> 31:21.880
of it all is that

31:22.680 --> 31:24.480
Young Master Luo
had no interest in studying,

31:24.480 --> 31:26.920
yet that little page boy
had exceptional talent

31:26.920 --> 31:28.180
and remarkable intelligence.

31:28.180 --> 31:30.530
He earned Luo Zhan's
high regard and appreciation,

31:30.530 --> 31:32.810
who graciously granted him
a certificate of freedom.

31:32.810 --> 31:34.610
Indeed, at fourteen,

31:34.670 --> 31:36.510
he topped the provincial examination.

31:36.510 --> 31:38.310
The countryside was astounded.

31:38.370 --> 31:41.400
Sadly, he couldn't take
the metropolitan examination.

31:41.400 --> 31:42.580
According to local rumors,

31:42.580 --> 31:45.080
Young Master Luo
resented his grandfather's favoritism,

31:45.080 --> 31:46.720
often beating and scolding

31:46.720 --> 31:47.740
the page boy as a child.

31:47.740 --> 31:49.310
After Luo Zhan passed away,

31:49.340 --> 31:51.120
the family held a grand funeral.

31:51.120 --> 31:52.010
He deliberately played tricks on

31:52.010 --> 31:53.680
Mr. Lu who came to pay respects,

31:53.680 --> 31:55.410
accidentally causing a death.

31:55.450 --> 31:56.770
Father! Wake up!

31:57.310 --> 31:58.270
Father, wake up!

31:58.750 --> 31:59.230
Father!

32:00.510 --> 32:01.840
Father, wake up.

32:02.160 --> 32:02.670
Father.

32:06.640 --> 32:08.880
Father!

32:12.640 --> 32:13.240
Father.

32:23.460 --> 32:24.550
What happened then?

32:24.550 --> 32:26.000
After the three-year
mourning period ended,

32:26.000 --> 32:27.370
he successfully passed

32:27.400 --> 32:29.410
the metropolitan, provincial
and palace examinations,

32:29.410 --> 32:30.940
achieved the highest rank,

32:31.060 --> 32:32.480
and was appointed to the Imperial Academy.

32:32.480 --> 32:33.720
As for Luo Chuance,

32:33.720 --> 32:35.200
he spent his days
bullying men and harassing women,

32:35.200 --> 32:36.200
committing all kinds of evil deeds.

32:36.200 --> 32:38.000
The people despised him deeply.

32:38.000 --> 32:40.720
Then one day,
he fell into the water while drunk.

32:46.330 --> 32:47.060
Don't worry.

32:48.960 --> 32:49.890
I won't kill you.

32:51.100 --> 32:52.210
The Luo family's inheritance

32:52.210 --> 32:54.470
has been completely gambled away by you.

32:55.070 --> 32:56.470
For the rest of your life,

32:58.450 --> 33:01.420
you can suffer in hell.

33:03.160 --> 33:05.020
Lord Lu put aside past grievances

33:05.170 --> 33:07.430
and rescued that villain from the water.

33:07.480 --> 33:09.670
Later, when the Luo family fell into ruin,

33:09.670 --> 33:10.800
it was also Lord Lu

33:11.110 --> 33:13.190
who remembered
Governor Luo's past kindness

33:13.190 --> 33:14.990
and provided support and care.

33:15.640 --> 33:17.240
When locals talk about this,

33:17.330 --> 33:19.290
who doesn't praise his generosity

33:19.400 --> 33:21.210
and how he returned good for evil?

33:21.210 --> 33:23.070
Sadly, heaven envied his talent.

33:23.440 --> 33:25.830
Earlier this year, he hurried
back to the capital from Linji.

33:25.830 --> 33:28.400
When his boat reached the middle
of the river, a sudden wave struck.

33:28.400 --> 33:31.130
The boat was destroyed,
and all aboard perished.

33:33.400 --> 33:34.440
Allperished?

33:35.460 --> 33:36.220
He's dead?

33:37.600 --> 33:39.290
Minister Xu himself
presided over the funeral

33:39.290 --> 33:41.820
and personally wrote
the memorial couplets.

33:47.830 --> 33:48.500
I see.

33:49.430 --> 33:50.230
You may go now.

33:50.720 --> 33:51.270
Yes.

33:59.260 --> 34:00.590
No wonder not a single person

34:00.590 --> 34:01.790
came looking for him.

34:01.950 --> 34:04.210
He went from a living person
to a dead one.

34:05.510 --> 34:06.350
Lu Jianglai,

34:07.220 --> 34:09.880
what kind of enmity
have you actually incurred?

34:10.280 --> 34:11.800
If I send you back now,

34:12.679 --> 34:13.440
it would undoubtedly

34:13.440 --> 34:14.639
lead you to a dead end.

34:16.230 --> 34:16.920
Just stay here

34:16.920 --> 34:18.190
at the Rong Mansion.

34:23.550 --> 34:24.710
You have no idea

34:24.830 --> 34:26.620
how lively it was last night.

34:27.320 --> 34:28.630
Unfortunately, I was in deep sleep

34:28.630 --> 34:30.110
and didn't witness it myself.

34:30.110 --> 34:31.400
Poor Cheng Guanyu

34:31.690 --> 34:33.120
who has always been

34:33.150 --> 34:34.750
so faithful to Lady Shanbao.

34:35.239 --> 34:37.170
Now he's been dragged down by them.

34:37.739 --> 34:40.940
I heard Ms. Yan will personally
carry out the punishment.

34:41.840 --> 34:42.840
That's not right.

34:44.909 --> 34:46.150
What's wrong with that?

34:46.150 --> 34:48.080
The Yang family is of noble lineage

34:48.230 --> 34:50.489
and often does business with our family.

34:50.670 --> 34:51.510
A mere servant

34:51.510 --> 34:52.800
who offended Mr. Yang

34:53.139 --> 34:55.070
should just be dealt with quietly.

34:55.150 --> 34:56.230
For what reason

34:56.880 --> 34:59.010
must they make such a big fuss about it?

34:59.060 --> 35:00.720
Of course it's for Cousin Wen.

35:01.190 --> 35:01.590
Could it be

35:01.590 --> 35:02.920
for that lowly servant?

35:03.670 --> 35:05.400
Yunyin, did you get a clear look

35:05.440 --> 35:06.840
at that person's look?

35:13.510 --> 35:14.030
Cuiwei,

35:14.550 --> 35:16.150
keep an eye on that Fusheng.

35:16.720 --> 35:17.280
Yes.

35:24.920 --> 35:25.840
Don't think I don't know

35:25.840 --> 35:27.280
what you're thinking.

35:27.970 --> 35:29.500
You deliberately stood by,

35:29.980 --> 35:32.350
letting those people
reveal their ugly sides,

35:32.350 --> 35:33.920
all to make Lady Shanbao
despise them even more!

35:33.920 --> 35:34.920
Isn't that right?

35:35.370 --> 35:36.400
They're nothing but

35:36.400 --> 35:38.600
bloodsucking flies drawn by the scent.

35:39.840 --> 35:42.410
They covet the Rong family's
tea mountains and wealth.

35:42.410 --> 35:43.130
All I did

35:44.320 --> 35:46.050
is simply letting Lady Shanbao

35:46.800 --> 35:48.360
see their true faces.

35:50.990 --> 35:52.190
Who do you think you are

35:52.190 --> 35:53.720
to meddle in their affairs?

35:53.840 --> 35:54.980
You must always remember

35:54.980 --> 35:57.640
you're just a beggar
taken in by the Rong family.

35:57.720 --> 35:59.610
Lady Shanbao provides
for your basic needs,

35:59.610 --> 36:01.380
the Rong family has educated you,

36:01.380 --> 36:03.580
so you should repay them with your life.

36:03.920 --> 36:06.000
Don't interfere with
your masters' affairs.

36:06.000 --> 36:07.120
And don't you dare

36:07.360 --> 36:08.190
have even the slightest

36:08.190 --> 36:09.790
filthy thought in your mind!

36:15.570 --> 36:16.530
I won't forget.

36:18.940 --> 36:21.200
I wouldn't dare forget in this lifetime.

36:23.720 --> 36:25.150
I raised you myself,

36:25.880 --> 36:27.230
so I must warn you.

36:28.030 --> 36:29.840
You grew up with her when you were young.

36:29.840 --> 36:31.230
You were like her brother

36:31.230 --> 36:32.630
and her close companion.

36:33.110 --> 36:35.960
But Lady Shanbao is the master
and you are the servant.

36:35.960 --> 36:37.620
Master and servant
are ultimately different.

36:37.620 --> 36:39.480
This boundary cannot be crossed.

36:40.030 --> 36:40.840
In the future,

36:40.870 --> 36:42.980
she will be matched
with a noble young master.

36:42.980 --> 36:45.040
How could you possibly aspire to her?

36:45.590 --> 36:47.780
If you continue to harbor
inappropriate thoughts,

36:47.780 --> 36:50.140
you'll end up with no place
for your body to rest.

36:50.140 --> 36:51.140
Think carefully.

36:57.440 --> 36:58.300
Steward Cheng!

37:07.260 --> 37:08.000
I merely

37:08.000 --> 37:09.530
drove away a swarm of flies.

37:10.610 --> 37:11.670
What did I do wrong?

37:16.820 --> 37:18.420
It's all your terrible idea.

37:18.730 --> 37:19.800
That vicious hound wouldn't die,

37:19.800 --> 37:21.660
and it ended up biting us instead.

37:23.000 --> 37:24.600
Why do you keep following me?

37:25.350 --> 37:27.320
Aren't we here
to apologize to Lady Shanbao?

37:27.320 --> 37:29.320
Mr. Yang, have you made up your mind?

37:34.450 --> 37:35.250
Lady Shanbao?

37:35.800 --> 37:36.600
Lady Shanbao.

37:41.000 --> 37:42.930
The mountain land that you've chosen

37:42.930 --> 37:44.590
can be cleared within a month.

37:45.000 --> 37:46.070
Those 3,000 tea plants

37:46.070 --> 37:47.930
will be transplanted there soon.

37:48.330 --> 37:50.550
Though the land by the water
on the east side of the mountain

37:50.550 --> 37:52.550
is occupied by mountain villagers,

37:53.230 --> 37:54.430
in my humble opinion,

37:54.760 --> 37:55.920
we can hire the men from the mountains

37:55.920 --> 37:56.920
to clear the land

37:57.510 --> 37:58.440
and send some skilled workers

37:58.440 --> 37:59.760
from our tea plantations

37:59.760 --> 38:02.190
to teach the women
how to pick and process tea leaves.

38:02.190 --> 38:04.590
We must not delay
the picking of the first spring tea.

38:04.590 --> 38:06.510
Discuss it with Yi
and proceed accordingly.

38:06.510 --> 38:08.510
Lady Shanbao, please rest assured.

38:09.400 --> 38:10.200
Lady Shanbao.

38:12.400 --> 38:13.200
Lady Shanbao!

38:18.260 --> 38:19.230
Lady Shanbao, could it be that

38:19.230 --> 38:20.760
you're still angry with me?

38:21.110 --> 38:22.000
Why were all

38:22.200 --> 38:23.660
the gifts I sent returned?

38:23.890 --> 38:25.360
Yesterday was a misunderstanding.

38:25.360 --> 38:26.510
I upset you,

38:26.840 --> 38:28.240
and I feel deeply uneasy.

38:28.670 --> 38:30.200
If you haven't forgiven me,

38:30.840 --> 38:33.030
I can neither eat nor sleep...

38:33.880 --> 38:35.480
Mr. Yang, you worry too much.

38:36.150 --> 38:37.800
It's been raining for the past few days,

38:37.800 --> 38:39.030
but today the sky has cleared up.

38:39.030 --> 38:40.890
And there's a north wind blowing.

38:41.000 --> 38:42.070
The tea plantation must be busy

38:42.070 --> 38:43.760
harvesting the first spring tea.

38:43.760 --> 38:44.670
I've heard Lady Shanbao

38:44.670 --> 38:46.230
handles everything personally.

38:46.230 --> 38:48.630
You must be heading
to the tea mountain now.

38:50.480 --> 38:52.550
Lady Shanbao, please.

38:54.000 --> 38:55.920
Truly worthy of being
the heir to Huqiu Tea,

38:55.920 --> 38:57.510
explaining everything about

38:57.510 --> 38:59.190
the tea plantation so thoroughly.

38:59.190 --> 39:00.630
Lady Shanbao is busy
with important matters.

39:00.630 --> 39:01.590
You and I should leave now.

39:01.590 --> 39:02.440
Let's go.

39:02.510 --> 39:04.360
What? Reluctant to move?

39:05.150 --> 39:06.480
I heard the Rong family has

39:06.480 --> 39:08.080
a tea tree over 300 years old.

39:08.190 --> 39:09.360
They've also sent people everywhere

39:09.360 --> 39:11.000
to collect precious tea varieties.

39:11.000 --> 39:12.360
In order to transplant

39:12.360 --> 39:14.070
a thousand-year-old
wild tea trees from Yunnan,

39:14.070 --> 39:15.960
they actually relocated

39:15.960 --> 39:16.800
an entire village,

39:16.800 --> 39:17.670
just to secure

39:17.670 --> 39:19.590
the best tea cultivators in the world.

39:19.590 --> 39:20.590
Such determination—

39:20.590 --> 39:22.450
your He family could never match.

39:22.840 --> 39:24.000
You've been following me

39:24.000 --> 39:25.150
around the tea plantation

39:25.150 --> 39:26.280
since early morning.

39:26.280 --> 39:27.800
Don't tell me you're after the tea.

39:27.800 --> 39:28.200
You...

39:28.880 --> 39:29.670
Lady Shanbao.

39:29.670 --> 39:31.000
Lady Shanbao has invited you

39:31.000 --> 39:32.190
to tour the tea mountain today.

39:32.190 --> 39:33.790
Please go back and get ready.

40:36.280 --> 40:37.280
This tea mountain

40:37.360 --> 40:38.630
has over 80 tea plantations,

40:38.630 --> 40:39.560
large and small,

40:39.590 --> 40:40.920
with over 1,000 tea workers.

40:40.920 --> 40:43.280
The tea plantations
provide food and lodging.

40:43.280 --> 40:44.440
The workers' children

40:44.440 --> 40:46.880
can study at
the Rong family's private school.

40:46.880 --> 40:48.590
In the prefectures and counties
near Linji alone,

40:48.590 --> 40:50.590
there are 6 more such tea mountains.

40:51.920 --> 40:53.780
Now is the spring harvest season.

40:53.880 --> 40:55.150
Although it's said in the trade

40:55.150 --> 40:56.590
that picking tea
before Qingming Festival is too early,

40:56.590 --> 40:57.880
and after the Beginning of Summer
is too late,

40:57.880 --> 41:00.190
with the best time
being around Grain Rain.

41:00.190 --> 41:01.760
But rarity brings value.

41:02.360 --> 41:03.760
Tea leaves picked before Qingming Festival

41:03.760 --> 41:04.800
are tender, fresh, and sweet,

41:04.800 --> 41:06.330
and more favored by people.

41:06.760 --> 41:08.280
Just one jin of tea bud heads

41:08.280 --> 41:09.280
requires seven or eight people

41:09.280 --> 41:10.740
picking for an entire day.

41:11.030 --> 41:11.630
And it must be done

41:11.630 --> 41:14.630
during these few days
when the leaves are most tender.

41:16.280 --> 41:17.810
So many young masters here.

41:43.510 --> 41:45.030
Gentlemen, please wait a moment.

41:45.030 --> 41:47.090
I'll go ahead and make preparations.

41:49.760 --> 41:51.280
Wasn't Lady Shanbao supposed to be here?

41:51.280 --> 41:52.670
Why hasn't she shown up yet?

41:52.670 --> 41:53.760
It's so muddy here.

41:54.230 --> 41:55.920
With such a grand estate,
how could the Rong family

41:55.920 --> 41:56.880
let their precious daughter

41:56.880 --> 41:57.840
suffer like this?

41:57.840 --> 41:59.510
Even a country gentry's daughter

41:59.510 --> 42:00.550
keeps her feet clean.

42:00.550 --> 42:02.190
Let's stop and rest for a while.

42:02.190 --> 42:03.150
My new robe.

42:03.440 --> 42:04.100
Take a rest.

42:09.510 --> 42:10.110
Mr. Wen,

42:11.960 --> 42:14.160
that night Mr. He invited me for drinks.

42:14.440 --> 42:16.370
I had a few too many and fell asleep.

42:16.440 --> 42:17.960
It almost caused a big mistake.

42:17.960 --> 42:19.230
If I had been there then,

42:19.230 --> 42:21.000
you wouldn't have been left helpless.

42:21.000 --> 42:22.440
I blame myself for being so gullible.

42:22.440 --> 42:23.550
One can be a thief for 1,000 days,

42:23.550 --> 42:25.070
but who can guard
against thieves for 1,000 days?

42:25.070 --> 42:26.380
My good brother, you're pure-hearted,

42:26.380 --> 42:28.150
certainly no match for others' schemes.

42:28.150 --> 42:28.950
Don't mind it.

42:29.450 --> 42:30.420
Who was so cruel?

42:30.840 --> 42:31.810
Let me see your injury.

42:31.810 --> 42:33.340
It's fine. Already healed.

42:35.110 --> 42:35.910
Young Master,

42:36.870 --> 42:38.280
look at that tea-picking girl.

42:38.280 --> 42:39.860
She's teaching how to pick tender leaves.

42:39.860 --> 42:40.840
This is the Rong family's

42:40.840 --> 42:42.360
foundation of livelihood.

42:42.360 --> 42:43.490
Since we're here at the tea plantation,

42:43.490 --> 42:45.550
why not learn about tea cultivation?

42:45.630 --> 42:46.880
It's not like I haven't seen it before.

42:46.880 --> 42:48.410
Why should I listen to that?

42:48.850 --> 42:50.690
Do you expect me to compete with the girls

42:50.690 --> 42:51.490
in dexterity?

42:52.230 --> 42:52.840
Exactly.

42:53.280 --> 42:54.840
And no beautiful ladies in sight either.

42:54.840 --> 42:56.040
What a waste of a trip.

42:56.280 --> 42:57.880
Let's go find Steward Cheng.

42:58.110 --> 42:58.630
Okay.

42:58.950 --> 42:59.480
Let's go.

43:00.750 --> 43:01.550
Young Master,

43:02.370 --> 43:03.700
stop wandering around.

43:04.190 --> 43:05.650
Why not listen for a while?

43:05.680 --> 43:08.140
Since we're here,
we might as well settle in.

43:10.760 --> 43:11.880
I noticed the tea workers

43:11.880 --> 43:13.870
are extremely respectful
to that tea-picking girl.

43:13.870 --> 43:15.110
I suspect her position
in the tea plantation

43:15.110 --> 43:15.770
is unusual.

43:16.360 --> 43:17.150
Be patient.

43:18.750 --> 43:19.150
Let's go.
